  {
   "id": "b09-text-10",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 128,
   "width": 826,
   "height": 28,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 79190,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1047290,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "The rule: Y is in P(N) if N’s path to Y doesn’t come back through S",
   "originalText": "The rule: Y is in P(N) if N’s path to Y doesn’t come back through S",
   "fontSize": 22,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b09-text-11",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 166,
   "width": 623,
   "height": 64,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 87109,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1152019,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Y ∈ P(N)   ⇔   dist(N,Y)  <  dist(N,S) + dist(S,Y)\n\nextended P-space  =  P(S)  ∪  P(N) for every other neighbor N",
   "originalText": "Y ∈ P(N)   ⇔   dist(N,Y)  <  dist(N,S) + dist(S,Y)\n\nextended P-space  =  P(S)  ∪  P(N) for every other neighbor N",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b09-text-12",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 240,
   "width": 981,
   "height": 107,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 95028,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1256748,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "•  S hands the packet to neighbor N (the tunnel goes out through N). N forwards on its normal table, so\n   the path from N on is N’s shortest path to Y.\n•  This is Inequality 1 (B3) with Y in place of D: N won’t send it back to S, and so never over S–E.\n•  S stores the exit neighbor with each extra node: the tunnel must leave through N, because S’s own\n   path to Y may use S–E.",
   "originalText": "•  S hands the packet to neighbor N (the tunnel goes out through N). N forwards on its normal table, so\n   the path from N on is N’s shortest path to Y.\n•  This is Inequality 1 (B3) with Y in place of D: N won’t send it back to S, and so never over S–E.\n•  S stores the exit neighbor with each extra node: the tunnel must leave through N, because S’s own\n   path to Y may use S–E.",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b09-text-13",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 357,
   "width": 447,
   "height": 24,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 102947,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1361477,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Worked checks, Example 8 (from the engine)",
   "originalText": "Worked checks, Example 8 (from the engine)",
   "fontSize": 19,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b09-text-14",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 391,
   "width": 747,
   "height": 113,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 110866,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1466206,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Y    P(S): dist(S,Y) < c(S,E) + dist(E,Y)   P(N): dist(N,Y) < dist(N,S) + dist(S,Y)\n---  -----------------------------------   ---------------------------------------\nN    2 < 2 + 4 = 6   ✓                       (N itself)\nB    3 < 2 + 1 = 3   ✗ tie                   3 < 2 + 3 = 5   ✓  exit via N\nC    6 < 2 + 4 = 6   ✗ tie                   6 < 2 + 6 = 8   ✓  exit via N\nD    4 < 2 + 2 = 4   ✗ tie                   6 < 2 + 4 = 6   ✗",
   "originalText": "Y    P(S): dist(S,Y) < c(S,E) + dist(E,Y)   P(N): dist(N,Y) < dist(N,S) + dist(S,Y)\n---  -----------------------------------   ---------------------------------------\nN    2 < 2 + 4 = 6   ✓                       (N itself)\nB    3 < 2 + 1 = 3   ✗ tie                   3 < 2 + 3 = 5   ✓  exit via N\nC    6 < 2 + 4 = 6   ✗ tie                   6 < 2 + 6 = 8   ✓  exit via N\nD    4 < 2 + 2 = 4   ✗ tie                   6 < 2 + 4 = 6   ✗",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b09-text-15",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 514,
   "width": 330,
   "height": 24,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 118785,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1570935,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "What it changes in each example",
   "originalText": "What it changes in each example",
   "fontSize": 19,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b09-text-16",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 548,
   "width": 639,
   "height": 113,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 126704,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1675664,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Example        Plain P(S)   Extended adds        PQ plain   PQ extended\n-------------  -----------  -------------------  ---------  -----------\n2  ring        {A, B}       C via A (2 < 3)      {B}        {B, C}\n3  ring, B–C   {A, B}       nothing (3 = 3)      {}         {}\n4  PE1–P1      {P2, P4}     PE2 via P2 (20<40)   {}         {PE2}\n8  S–E         {N}          B, C via N           {}         {B, C}",
   "originalText": "Example        Plain P(S)   Extended adds        PQ plain   PQ extended\n-------------  -----------  -------------------  ---------  -----------\n2  ring        {A, B}       C via A (2 < 3)      {B}        {B, C}\n3  ring, B–C   {A, B}       nothing (3 = 3)      {}         {}\n4  PE1–P1      {P2, P4}     PE2 via P2 (20<40)   {}         {PE2}\n8  S–E         {N}          B, C via N           {}         {B, C}",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b09-text-17",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 671,
   "width": 959,
   "height": 40,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#495057",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
