   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Takeaway",
   "originalText": "Takeaway",
   "fontSize": 22,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b09-text-63",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 18,
   "y": 1033,
   "width": 1590,
   "height": 43,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 498897,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 6597927,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "S can tunnel out through any other neighbor N, and N then forwards normally. So every router N reaches without coming back through S is safe too: dist(N,Y) < dist(N,S)\n+ dist(S,Y). That bigger set often holds the PQ node that plain P-space misses (Examples 4 and 8).",
   "originalText": "S can tunnel out through any other neighbor N, and N then forwards normally. So every router N reaches without coming back through S is safe too: dist(N,Y) < dist(N,S)\n+ dist(S,Y). That bigger set often holds the PQ node that plain P-space misses (Examples 4 and 8).",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b09-text-64",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 1108,
   "width": 1497,
   "height": 40,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#495057",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 506816,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 6702656,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Sources: docs/02-algorithms.md §3, §6  ·  docs/learn/05-remote-lfa.md (Extended P-space)  ·  examples/08-node-protection.yaml, 02-ring5.yaml, 03-ring5-highmetric.yaml,\n04-isp-core.yaml  ·  checked with computeForSource()",
   "originalText": "Sources: docs/02-algorithms.md §3, §6  ·  docs/learn/05-remote-lfa.md (Extended P-space)  ·  examples/08-node-protection.yaml, 02-ring5.yaml, 03-ring5-highmetric.yaml,\n04-isp-core.yaml  ·  checked with computeForSource()",
   "fontSize": 16,
